<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Perclose upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Perclose upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Vector Securities analyst David Gruber said he upgraded Perclose Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the medical technology company were up 1/4 to 21.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
